<h2>MCC Digital Collections Acknowledgements</h2>

<p>The MCC Digital Collections (MCCDC) houses&nbsp;both the scholarly and creative&nbsp;output of faculty and students&nbsp;along with historical materials of the College that are held in its Archives.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>Partnerships with college units enable collection of these works. For example, work with the College&#39;s Publications Office enabled addition of such publications as Middlesex Now and This Month @ Middlesex. Partnerships with Natural Sciences allowed us to curate a collection of student symposium documentation. The Library&#39;s Community in Focus collection includes student and Library&nbsp;developed items. Copyright is held by the copyright owner for most items, but the library&#39;s publications are provided with Creative Commons licenses.</p>

<p><strong>Collection Development Lead and SobekCM Liaison: </strong>Marilyn N. Ochoa</p>

<p><strong>Archives Liaison</strong>: Adriana Mamay, Elisabeth Oliu, Rachel Pieters</p>

<p><strong>Interface and Banner Designs: </strong>Emma Fasano,&nbsp;Jennifer Miller, Marilyn N. Ochoa</p>

<p>The library and learning center staff work to&nbsp;provide scanning as necessary, quality control, and record creation to develop these collections, as below. Partners are listed on the collections information pages.</p>

