	<li><strong><a href="http://middlesexcc.sobeklibrary.com/l/contains/?t=%22Literacy%22&amp;f=SU">Library Displays and Events</a></strong>:&nbsp;Emma Fasano, Marilyn N. Ochoa, and&nbsp;Rachel Pieters&nbsp;</li>
